# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Sample environment file
#
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in real values for local development:
#     cp .env.example .env
#
# `.env` is already listed in `.gitignore`; never commit a populated copy.
# Secrets reach the code as environment variables only. Locally, `.env` is
# the one file that holds them: no key files, no credential files. See
# AGENTS.md.
#
# Lists every environment variable the application reads at run time, with a
# comment saying what it's for and placeholder values only. Development and
# test switches (e.g. RUN_INTEGRATION) don't belong here. Load it with
#     uv run --env-file .env <command>
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
